        "payload": "tree 70dc593bbbf6b3d1169ace173b356ee4e1d80439\nparent 11494efb01d0a7d1097319c82af77bdb4bf69e21\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1790720728 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1790791806 -0700\n\ncompressor: replace oversized scripts instead of appending\n\nThe oversized-script fallback appends OP_RETURN to the destination rather than replacing it as documented.\nA reused target retains its previous contents, and an incomplete push can consume OP_RETURN as data.\nAssign a new OP_RETURN script before skipping the oversized payload so the result is independent of the destination's prior contents.\n\n\n\n\n",
