      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "> Not sure, reusing a destination would be an unrelated bug?\r\n\r\nWe do have some existing reuses, e.g. in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/e7aef7e86da79000aa42f5ba6d13b0d123d9da7c/src/rpc/blockchain.cpp#L3435-L3462 the snapshot export reuses the same `Coin` in the loop. Regardless, added a comment clarifying that this tests the fallback directly, since normal UTXO insertion excludes oversized scripts.",
